@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Default,Angle01/Option_Arms-,ArmR-Option-Off,ArmR2,ArmL3,Angle01/Head/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open01,Angle01/Head/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:AnAn Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:一开始我们<br>不是还讨论过<br>有可能本来就<br>没上锁吗！|#0102Trial12_AnAn002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Default,Angle01/Option_Arms-,ArmR-Option-Off,ArmR2,ArmL5,Angle01/Head/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open01,Angle01/Head/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Uncomfortable_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:AnAn Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"米莉亚<br><link=\"Objection_01_02_12_01\">被绑</link>在那个房间里！<br>那么即使<br><link=\"Objection_01_02_12_02\">门没有上锁</link><br>也很正常……！<br>|#0102Trial12_AnAn003|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Default,Angle01/Option_Arms-,ArmR-Option-Off,ArmR2,ArmL11,Angle01/Head/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open01,Angle01/Head/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Uncomfortable_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:AnAn Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:关于这点，<br>艾玛刚才已经证明过了！|#0102Trial12_AnAn004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.ArmL5,Angle01/ArmR-,Eyes1_Normal_Open2,Mouth1_Normal_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:问题并不是<br>门没有上锁，<br>而是钥匙不在<br>看守的手里。<br><br><br>|#0102Trial12_Nanoka001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.ArmL5,Angle01/ArmR-,Eyes1_Angry_Open1,Mouth1_Normal_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:钥匙在我的手里……<br>你该怎么解释<br>这件事？|#0102Trial12_Nanoka002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Default,Angle01/Option_Arms-,ArmR-Option-Off,ArmR2,ArmL11,Angle01/Head/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open02,Angle01/Head/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Uncomfortable_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:AnAn Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:解释这件事<br>可太容易了！|#0102Trial12_AnAn005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Default,Angle01/Option_Arms-,ArmR-Option-Off,ArmR2,ArmL5,Angle01/Head/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open01,Angle01/Head/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Uncomfortable_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:AnAn Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"可能是<link=\"Objection_01_02_12_03\">奈叶香你偷</link>的，<br>也可能是<br><link=\"Objection_01_02_12_04\">看守丢在里面忘拿了</link>……<br>不能说可能性为零！|#0102Trial12_AnAn006|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Default,Angle01/Option_Arms-,ArmR-Option-Off,ArmR2,ArmL5,Angle01/Head/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Closed,Angle01/Head/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Uncomfortable_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:AnAn Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"每个证据都已经<br>讨论充分了！<br>再说下去也不会<br><link=\"Objection_01_02_12_05\">有人能拿出新的情报</link>来！<br>再继续讨论下去<br>也没有任何意义！<br>|#0102Trial12_AnAn007|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Default,Angle01/Option_Arms-,ArmR-Option-Off,ArmR2,ArmL11,Angle01/Head/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open01,Angle01/Head/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Yell_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:AnAn Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……不惜<br>找这么多由头<br>也要处刑吾辈的<br>樱羽艾玛……<br>你们<color=#9c8eff><b>【该投票】</b></color><br>给她才对！|#0102Trial12_AnAn008| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR7,ArmL14,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:不知道为什么<br>我也有这种想法了！<br>艾玛，<br>可以给你<br>投票吗？|#0102Trial12_Sherry001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1,ArmR3,ArmL1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Confused_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:当然不可以啊！？|#0102Trial12_Ema001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

